{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處境劇《愛·回家之開心速遞》將於8月初迎來大結局。日前，近 100 位新舊演員齊集電視城錄影廠，為結局周的重頭戲進行拍攝，現場場面極為壯觀且熱鬧。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">官方率先發布了拍攝花絮，一眾劇中主演如三太（樊亦敏飾）、熊尚善（滕麗名飾）、熊若水（呂慧儀飾）、金城安（周嘉洛飾）、朱凌凌（吳偉豪飾）、送水輝（許家傑飾）、潮偉（袁文傑飾）、龔燁（張景淳飾）及熊樹仁（單立文飾）等，全線以瘋狂載歌載舞的造型亮相，預示結局周將有一場精彩絕倫的歌舞演出，以回饋觀眾多年來的支持。</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">在現場人海中，多位驚喜面孔成為焦點，包括姚焯菲（Chantel）驚喜現身，並與金城安（周嘉洛飾）開心打招呼。而劇中的「鎮山之寶」——組合「大四喜」，由熊樹根（劉丹飾）、大龍生（羅樂林飾）、譚道德（陳榮峻飾）及龍敢佳（鍾志光飾）領軍，齊齊換上標誌性的彩色 Hip Hop 造型在舞台上表演，令不少鐵粉大呼感動。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d5b204d3-2733-4bc3-9870-281e4197adda.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026oBqpPJIf5i1784603476.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d5b204d3-2733-4bc3-9870-281e4197adda.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"78002f0a-6da3-4dc8-ab9d-971ef5202d51.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026ctF2xDGezQ1784603472.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"78002f0a-6da3-4dc8-ab9d-971ef5202d51.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">除了滿滿的集體回憶外，官方釋出的劇照中藏有一個重要訊息：打扮亮麗的「大小姐」龍力蓮（林淑敏飾）全程笑容滿面，拍攝期間更一度做出「掩肚」動作。此舉引起網民熱議，紛紛揣測這對恩愛夫妻——大小姐與送水輝（許家傑飾），在迎來結局之際，是否終於要迎來喜訊，令這段長跑愛情圓滿升級？</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9cfeaf31-4be9-4662-bb61-b38f931e233a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026x5q0RmMM581784603463.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9cfeaf31-4be9-4662-bb61-b38f931e233a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-22T13:19:00.910671+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":518,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}